and hand marsil over to

284
00:16:07,870 --> 00:16:09,850
why not say something sooner

285
00:16:09,850 --> 00:16:11,650
what's the point in telling me now

286
00:16:11,650 --> 00:16:13,870
if it was so hard to be around me

287
00:16:13,870 --> 00:16:15,970
you sure told me back then so i knew

288
00:16:15,970 --> 00:16:19,930
i tried to let you know in ways that most people would have picked up on

289
00:16:19,930 --> 00:16:22,530
maybe you should get better at reading the room laos

290
00:16:22,530 --> 00:16:26,150
how sure oh i'd finally made my very first friend on the island

291
00:16:26,150 --> 00:16:29,790
did you expect me not to be excited about it

292
00:16:29,790 --> 00:16:31,790
don't look at me like that

293
00:16:31,790 --> 00:16:33,550
i hate it so much

294
00:16:33,550 --> 00:16:37,930
that sincere look in your eyes while you shove your burdens onto everyone else

295
00:16:37,930 --> 00:16:40,150
how was i supposed to know that

296
00:16:40,150 --> 00:16:41,850
you don't ever talk

297
00:16:41,850 --> 00:16:43,030
heck you don't even eat

298
00:16:43,030 --> 00:16:45,370
what's the point did you even having a mouth at all

299
00:16:45,370 --> 00:16:48,190
shut up you fool

300
00:16:48,190 --> 00:16:51,590
you haven't even put in half the effort marsil does each day

301
00:16:51,590 --> 00:16:53,590
i really don't think now's the time for this

302
00:16:53,590 --> 00:16:55,270
what a childish squabble

303
00:16:55,270 --> 00:16:58,450
i thought i had taught him better than this

304
00:16:58,450 --> 00:17:01,370
if you include me there are seven dead

305
00:17:01,370 --> 00:17:02,730
one heavily injured

306
00:17:02,730 --> 00:17:04,250
and then three missing

307
00:17:04,250 --> 00:17:06,890
the gnom and i could each revive half

308
00:17:06,890 --> 00:17:08,530
but there isn't enough blood left

309
00:17:08,530 --> 00:17:09,710
senshi

310
00:17:09,710 --> 00:17:12,150
can you gather all the scattered ingredients

311
00:17:12,150 --> 00:17:13,190
will do

312
00:17:13,190 --> 00:17:14,550
if needed

313
00:17:14,550 --> 00:17:16,610
i can cast a simple revival

314
00:17:16,610 --> 00:17:18,290
no that will not be necessary

315
00:17:18,290 --> 00:17:24,770
but you can help by healing the wounded and finding those who are missing

316
00:17:24,770 --> 00:17:27,410
cast anything strange and i will cut you down

317
00:17:46,610 --> 00:17:54,410
you see ishiro

318
00:17:54,410 --> 00:17:57,970
guess who's stronger because they've been eating proper daily meals

319
00:17:57,970 --> 00:17:58,990
it's me

320
00:17:58,990 --> 00:18:01,270
c-curses

321
00:18:01,270 --> 00:18:16,270
tasty

322
00:18:16,270 --> 00:18:18,390
my lord

323
00:18:18,390 --> 00:18:20,010
everyone has been revived

324
00:18:20,010 --> 00:18:22,930
shall we make preparations to depart soon

325
00:18:22,930 --> 00:18:24,750
no

326
00:18:24,750 --> 00:18:26,450
prepare a returning spell

327
00:18:26,450 --> 00:18:27,950
we're going back

328
00:18:27,950 --> 00:18:29,730
are you sure my lord

329
00:18:29,730 --> 00:18:32,370
we still haven't located ossipi

330
00:18:32,370 --> 00:18:35,090
she'll find her way back if she wants to

331
00:18:35,090 --> 00:18:37,130
we're deeply sorry my lord

332
00:18:37,130 --> 00:18:38,490
we weren't strong enough

333
00:18:38,490 --> 00:18:39,510
no

334
00:18:39,510 --> 00:18:42,270
i know you all did your very best

335
00:18:42,270 --> 00:18:43,830
thank you

336
00:18:43,830 --> 00:18:46,570
i'm grateful you joined me

337
00:18:46,570 --> 00:18:52,810
i'm returning to my country

338
00:18:52,810 --> 00:18:55,690
i won't be coming back to this island

339
00:18:55,690 --> 00:18:58,350
once on the surface

340
00:18:58,350 --> 00:19:00,350
i'll report to the island lord

341
00:19:00,350 --> 00:19:01,910
i see

342
00:19:01,910 --> 00:19:05,610
i'd planned to return with felon

343
00:19:05,610 --> 00:19:07,790
did she accept your proposal

344
00:19:07,790 --> 00:19:09,490
i don't know

345
00:19:09,490 --> 00:19:13,090
she asked for some time to think about it

346
00:19:13,090 --> 00:19:15,310
so i've been waiting

347
00:19:15,310 --> 00:19:26,570
i've never met a woman as fascinating as her

348
00:19:26,570 --> 00:19:29,670
i love her voice

349
00:19:29,670 --> 00:19:31,550
the way she thinks

350
00:19:31,550 --> 00:19:34,770
her beautiful smile

351
00:19:34,770 --> 00:19:39,470
the unfortunate thing is

352
00:19:39,470 --> 00:19:42,110
i never told her exactly how i felt

353
00:19:42,110 --> 00:19:45,030
i wish i would have told her sooner

354
00:19:45,030 --> 00:19:47,030
what

355
00:19:47,030 --> 00:19:48,810
he proposed out of nowhere

356
00:19:48,810 --> 00:19:49,690
how bizarre

357
00:19:49,690 --> 00:19:52,370
that's kinda just the world he lives in

358
00:19:52,370 --> 00:19:53,650
don't you worry

359
00:19:53,650 --> 00:19:55,650
i'll make sure to tell her for you

360
00:19:55,650 --> 00:20:01,230
it's this side of you laios

361
00:20:01,230 --> 00:20:04,690
that i envy

362
00:20:04,690 --> 00:20:08,890
hey uh

363
00:20:08,890 --> 00:20:10,970
you were a huge help in all this

364
00:20:10,970 --> 00:20:12,630
no not really

365
00:20:12,630 --> 00:20:14,610
my last attack was meaningless

366
00:20:14,610 --> 00:20:17,810
no i was able to learn several things because of it

367
00:20:17,810 --> 00:20:18,550
you were

368
00:20:18,550 --> 00:20:22,090
each of the places you stabbed would have been fatal for a human

369
00:20:22,090 --> 00:20:24,070
but that wasn't the case for my sister

370
00:20:24,070 --> 00:20:27,690
which means either those areas don't have vital organs

371
00:20:27,690 --> 00:20:29,270
or there are multiple of them

372
00:20:29,270 --> 00:20:31,850
there are lots of monsters like basilisks

373
00:20:31,850 --> 00:20:34,390
cerberus and psyllas that have multiple brains

374
00:20:34,390 --> 00:20:36,490
it's common for chimera types

375
00:20:36,490 --> 00:20:39,870
he looks so excited right now

376
00:20:39,870 --> 00:20:42,370
guess he really does like monsters

377
00:20:42,370 --> 00:20:44,350
is this knowledge his weapon

378
00:20:44,350 --> 00:20:47,130
he says he'll defeat the mad mage

379
00:20:47,130 --> 00:20:49,630
there are definitely people who come into the dungeon

380
00:20:49,630 --> 00:20:51,070
who are more skilled than him

381
00:20:51,070 --> 00:20:53,890
but they don't have the same motivation and knowledge he does

382
00:20:53,890 --> 00:20:55,330
i think she hesitated

383
00:20:55,330 --> 00:20:57,230
i honestly believe he can accomplish it

384
00:20:57,230 --> 00:20:59,210
although

385
00:20:59,210 --> 00:21:02,390
what's gonna happen after he does

386
00:21:02,390 --> 00:21:05,270
whoever manages to defeat the mad mage

387
00:21:05,270 --> 00:21:07,270
is said to obtain the entire country

388
00:21:07,270 --> 00:21:10,070
but what if that means

389
00:21:10,070 --> 00:21:13,030
that person becomes the next lord of the dungeon

390
00:21:13,030 --> 00:21:17,110
what will this man do when he's in possession of this country

391
00:21:17,110 --> 00:21:19,610
built by black magic and all these monsters

392
00:21:19,610 --> 00:21:22,830
will he seal away this dungeon without a word

393
00:21:22,830 --> 00:21:25,390
hey are you hungry

394
00:21:25,390 --> 00:21:48,050
what even is this

395
00:21:48,050 --> 00:21:50,350
it's samago yaki made from some harpy eggs

396
00:21:50,350 --> 00:21:54,690
senshi found a few a little while ago

397
00:21:54,690 --> 00:21:57,470
you said you were interested in monster cuisine right

398
00:21:57,470 --> 00:21:58,690
you should try one

399
00:21:58,690 --> 00:22:07,370
i do not want to eat that

400
00:22:07,370 --> 00:22:09,910
what do i do to get myself out of this

401
00:22:09,910 --> 00:22:11,790
maybe i could just kill him

402
00:22:11,790 --> 00:22:12,970
kill

403
00:22:12,970 --> 00:22:14,550
no i can't

404
00:22:14,550 --> 00:22:15,570
thanks leos

405
00:22:15,570 --> 00:22:16,730
of course

406
00:22:16,730 --> 00:22:20,130
he'll do literally anything just to get on someone's good side

407
00:22:20,130 --> 00:22:21,890
this guy's amazing

408
00:22:21,890 --> 00:22:37,570
preparations for the returning spell are now complete

409
00:22:37,570 --> 00:22:39,690
is anyone still injured

410
00:22:39,690 --> 00:22:41,510
once we're on the surface

411
00:22:41,510 --> 00:22:43,150
revival spells won't work

412
00:22:43,150 --> 00:22:44,930
if i'm being honest

413
00:22:44,930 --> 00:22:49,090
i'm fairly confident you'll perish even before reaching the mad mage

414
00:22:49,090 --> 00:22:51,830
but if you do manage to survive

415
00:22:51,830 --> 00:22:55,670
and you cannot return to the surface because of the black magic

416
00:22:55,670 --> 00:22:57,750
ring the spell

417
00:22:57,750 --> 00:23:00,850
it will resonate with its twin from anywhere

418
00:23:00,850 --> 00:23:02,450
when it does

419
00:23:02,450 --> 00:23:05,510
i'll send one of my people to help you flee to the east

420
00:23:05,510 --> 00:23:07,930
don't die

421
00:23:07,930 --> 00:23:10,930
thank you

422
00:23:10,930 --> 00:23:13,370
leos

423
00:23:13,370 --> 00:23:14,910
i'm glad that we met

424
00:23:14,910 --> 00:23:17,230
i got so much out of talking to you

425
00:23:17,230 --> 00:23:18,610
same for me

426
00:23:18,610 --> 00:23:19,830
um

427
00:23:19,830 --> 00:23:21,790
it's time to leave

428
00:23:21,790 --> 00:23:24,290
you do actually remember my name don't you

429
00:23:24,290 --> 00:23:24,890
hmm

430
00:23:24,890 --> 00:23:26,550
of course i do

431
00:23:26,550 --> 00:23:27,430
i'm glad

432
00:23:27,430 --> 00:23:31,170
i hope you still remember it next time

433
00:23:31,170 --> 00:23:33,270
well then

434
00:23:33,270 --> 00:23:34,210
see ya

435
00:23:34,210 --> 00:23:36,210
next time

436
00:23:36,210 --> 00:23:38,930
let's go leos

437
00:23:38,930 --> 00:23:40,990
there's no turning back anymore

438
00:23:40,990 --> 00:23:43,870
i knew it

439
00:23:43,870 --> 00:23:46,310
i had a feeling it was gonna turn out like this

440
00:23:46,310 --> 00:23:47,110
and i was right

441
00:23:47,110 --> 00:23:48,010
damn it

442
00:23:48,010 --> 00:23:49,990
hey now let's settle down

443
00:23:49,990 --> 00:23:51,910
sorry guys

444
00:23:51,910 --> 00:23:56,990
things will work out somehow

